Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:23.54,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,4000,4800)\pos(636.012,531.236)}Leap Over Tán Creek
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:20.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After unifying the northern realms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:25.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao ordered to build "Bronze Sparrow Terrace" on the bank of the Zhang River,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:28.46,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: "Bronze Sparrow Terrace" ({\fnYu Gothic\fs22}铜雀台{\fn\fs}) was a real terrace located in Yè city, Hebei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:28.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to commemorate his great achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:33.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He garrisoned his troops around Xǔchāng and fiefed them land to cultivate, to build up their strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:40.06,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Wú, named after the ancient state of Zhou dynasty, corresponds to areas south of the Yangtze River, AKA. Jiangdong or Jiangnan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:40.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and prepare for his expedition southwards: first to conquer Jing Province, then take the lands of Wú.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:45.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei turned to Liu Biao in Jing Province\Nafter his defeat at Runan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:48.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When Cao Cao was warring in the north, \NXǔchāng was weakly defended.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:52.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(957.333,470.667)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:55.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei proposed an attack on Xǔchāng several times, but his proposals were never accepted by Liu Biao.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:04:00.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the spring of the 12th year of Jian'an period,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.94,0:04:06.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Biao's surrendered generals, Zhang Wu and Chen Sun, rebelled at Jiangxia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:11.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei led Guan Yu, Zhang Fei, and Zhao Yun\Non a punitive expedition,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:15.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and crushed the rebellion of Chen Sun and Zhang Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Zǐlóng, you truly are a valiant warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:21.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.012,469.091)}Zhào Yún \NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.18,0:04:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done a marvelous job.\NThe rebellion at Jiangxia has been crushed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:49.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,3700,4500)\pos(315.537,508.121)}Liú Bèi\N Styled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and the people can live in peace.\NI must say that all the credit should go to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:52.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,5700,6500)\pos(962.868,493.454)}Liú Biǎo \NStyled: Jǐngshēng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.50,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've prepared a banquet in your honor\Nto celebrate the triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I serve under your command.\NIt is my duty to repay your kindness with gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:04:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After you, brother Jǐngshēng.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good horse.\NA great horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.235,496)}Cài Mào\NStyled: Déguī
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This was Zhang Wu's horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A good horse indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, since you like the horse this much, \Nthen I'd like to offer it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(463.19,503.182)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! My brother, that will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:40.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(971.406,468.243)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:06:03.14,Note (Potential Style),,0,0,0,,Note: The choreography depicts the characters "迎皇叔" or "Welcome, Uncle."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:35.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(934.418,451.939)}Yī Jí\NStyled: Jībó
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}With your great talent, \NJing Province is now safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Though the rebellion of Jiangxia has been crushed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}the nine commanderies and forty-two counties of Jing aren't free from outside disturbances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}\NAttacks and harassments by \Nthe Nanyue are still troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}And the strong forces of {\i1}Zhāng Lǔ {\i0}and{\i1} Sūn Quán{\i0}\Nhave only added to my worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}You don't need to worry,\Nmy three warrior-generals will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Zhang Fei can guard the southern border along Nanyue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Guan Yu can defend the city of Guzi \Nto be a deterrent force to Zhang Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}And Zhao Yun can patrol {\i1}the Three Rivers{\i0}\N to watch out for Sun Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:27.94,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: The Three Rivers aka. Sānjiāng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}So brother, are you still worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Well in that case, Jing Province will be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.70,0:07:39.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,That Liu Bei harbors ill will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:43.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He had to come to Jing Province after his defeat by Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He had nowhere else to seek refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Today he came back in triumph, and tried his best to win the favor of my brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, he managed to appoint three of \Nhis warrior-generals to important posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the defense of Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:57.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(343.307,429.546)}Lady Cài
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,has fallen into the hands of Liu Bei \Nand his subordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei's generals are at three key strategic positions, while he himself stays here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As I see it, the longer this goes, the more disastrous it will be for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've often heard from your brother-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.02,0:08:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that Liu Bei is a man of profound ambition and a great shrewdness, like a closed book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you must prevent my brother-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,from handing over Jing Province to Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:27.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please look for a chance to persuade my brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Attendant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I lying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You got drunk at the banquet and was brought back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I was in high spirits. \NI guess I did drink a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I find you've indeed become muddle-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, why would you entrust the defense of Jing Province to outsiders so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you've assigned the defense of Jing Province to the three generals under Liu Bei's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His men are all valiant and fierce. I like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you trust other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear that since his arrival in Jing Province, Liu Bei has been getting along with the officials and officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be caught off guard by this kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, he's assigned his generals to important places.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,While he himself remains in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything should go wrong one day, how would you deal with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is a kind and righteous person.\NLet us not suspect him without evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After Liu Bei's defeat at Runan, none of the lords dared to shelter him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody had kindness like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it'd be for the best to send Liu Bei out of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good horse!\NTruly a good horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This horse must not be ridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}My liege, this horse has "tear tracks" under its eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Its name is {\i1}"Dilu."{\i0} It will harm its rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}Zhang Wu died because of this horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}My lord should never ride it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}"Dilu" is a good horse indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}However, good horses should be used for close combat on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Liu Xuande is a veteran fighter \Nof countless battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}As the saying goes: \N"a treasured horse matches only a gallant warrior."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}It would be proper to return the horse to its master, Liu Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you come here for, my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been sitting all day doing nothing, \Nso I've come here to practice riding to pass the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.014,668.182)}{\bord12.545}If you find days dragging on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581}you could lead your troops to the county of Xinye in Xiāngyáng, and station them there for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}It's a prosperous place with ample provisions to support a battalion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.06,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Besides, staying still for too long would be a waste of your martial talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}I'm grateful for that great steed you gave me the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}but you are a soldier, fighting on the battlefield. You need a great steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}I shouldn't have taken the horse away from you.\NSo I give it back to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.90,0:12:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I can't but take the horse back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Many thanks, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.22,0:12:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Lord Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know your name, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I am {\i1}Yī Jí,{\i0}\Nan apparitor of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you'd like to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General, this horse must not be ridden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.54,0:13:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave it to Lord Liu Biao, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.78,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he has returned it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}That is because Kuǎi Yuè told Lord Liu Biao,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}that this horse is named "Dilu" and that it will harm its rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}That's why Lord Liu Biao returned the horse\Nback to you. How can you ride it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}Thank you for your kindness, I did not know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}However, everyone has his destiny. How can a horse change it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}You're known as a kindhearted and righteous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}If you don't mind,\NI'd like to pay a visit to you at Xinye some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.30,0:13:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, you're flattering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome at my place any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so kind.\NGoodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A few days ago, Lady Gān dreamed that she had swallowed the stars of the Big Dipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, this is a good omen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:57.02,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: The turtle shells and sticks on Sun Qian's table are part of historical Chinese divination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:58.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(952.853,469.121)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby to be born\Nmust be a man of great expectation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a good omen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You are about to get an honorable son! \NMy congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and find out if the baby is a boy or a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a boy! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.90,0:15:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Things turned out as expected!\NMy congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, my elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My elder brother, give a name to my nephew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, think of a name with good omen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Let's think of a name... think of a name...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since my lady dreamed of swallowing the Big Dipper,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,we may give him the name {\i1}Ēdǒu!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:04.22,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,(or Ādǒu. "Dǒu" means the Big Dipper)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, my elder brother! You now have a son, and the Hàn Dynasty has a new scion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and have a look at my nephew!\NLet's go! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Many thanks, sir!\NIt's kind of you to come to me in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for not coming to meet you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu Biao sent me\Nto invite you to Jing Province for a talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.78,0:16:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.06,0:16:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother, I see you are getting light-headed.\NWe'd better stop drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are better than me.\NI have no one to talk to about my worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NIf there is anything the matter, you can just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Cao Cao is in the capital of Xǔ with his soldiers back from his northern conquests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}The Yuán clan of Hebei have all been eliminated,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Cao Cao must have already begun planning his conquest of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Back then, I didn't heed your advice to attack Cao Cao while he was away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}I lost a good opportunity. Now how much I regret!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}My brother, there is no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:18:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Right now, the Empire is still in disarray.\NWar breaks out every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}There will be other opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}Brother, why are you so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545} I have been trying to tell you my worries.\NBut I have never had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545} You don't have to worry.\NIf I am of any help to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}By hook or by crook, I will do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}I am worried about my two sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}My former wife gave birth to my first son, {\i1}Liú Qí.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}He is virtuous, but too weak and timid to manage the state affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.18,0:18:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}My second wife gave birth to my younger son,{\i1} Liú Cóng.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}He's a bright boy, I like him very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}If I set aside the elder and make the younger my successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}I'd be going against the way of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}If I name the elder as my successor,\Nwhat can I do with the Cài Family?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}The military power of Jing Province \Nis in their hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}and they are sure to cause trouble in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.02,0:19:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}That's why I'm wavering and can't make the decision, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}This is a matter of your family. \NIt needs to be considered carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}My interference would be improper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}We're just like brothers.\NI hope you'll speak without reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Choosing the successor is of extreme importance. One should never act impetuously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:20:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}Since ancient times, removing the elder and choosing the younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}has been the source of disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}If you're worried about the Cai clan's power,\Nyou could reduce it over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}You can't make the younger the successor only because you dote on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}The days and months are slipping by, and I'm becoming old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}But my great deeds are still to be accomplished...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}I hear that while you were in Xǔchāng,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.58,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}you and Cao Cao talked about heroes over green plums and wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.30,0:20:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581}You proposed many famous men of our present time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}but Cao Cao just said that: "There are only two heroes of these lands, you and himself."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.62,0:21:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}With all his power and influence，\NCao Cao didn't place himself before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}Why do you have to worry about great deeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}My only hurdle is that I don't have any armies or land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}if I had a real solid base, the lesser men of the world are indeed not worth worrying over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight at midnight,\NI will send men to surround Liu Bei's guesthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll kill him first and then tell my brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure not to leak this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.86,0:21:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.86,0:21:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.66,0:21:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.86,0:21:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, sir, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a panic?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, you're still kept in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao has sent troops to kill you tonight! \NPlease return to Xīnyě immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.46,0:22:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Biao knows nothing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cais plans to act first and report later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no time for hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I go without saying goodbye to Brother Jingsheng?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you will be killed by Cai's men for certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. I will repay your kindness in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Be quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Search it!\NHurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who leaked our plans?\NLiu Bei must have gotten away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.22,0:22:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:10.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}"Too long, far too long. I have been stuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:13.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}gazing at the old mountains and rivers day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.94,0:23:16.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}{\pos(646.014,668.182)}A dragon can never be kept in a pond,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:18.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.545}he should ride on the thunder\N to Heaven and beyond."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill this ingrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.94,0:23:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been with Xuande quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.62,0:23:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him write poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be a plot by someone else to drive a wedge between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.62,0:24:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother-in-law, a person's heart is unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.10,0:24:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting Liu Bei go is like releasing a tiger into wilderness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.34,0:24:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go to Xinye and catch Liu Bei at once\Nto avoid future trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.42,0:24:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be reckless. There's no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.14,0:24:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not lose the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.38,0:24:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, you release a tiger into wilderness!\NTomorrow, it will be too late to regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.34,0:25:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.82,0:25:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter from Lord Liu Biao.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.78,0:25:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.42,0:25:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.14,0:25:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My three brothers, Mr Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.66,0:25:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu Biao has sent me a letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.46,0:25:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,asking me to preside over the Harvest Festival in Xiāngyáng on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.94,0:25:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't he himself preside over the festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.02,0:25:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jingsheng is not in good health recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His two sons are too young.\NHe is afraid of a violation of etiquette if they preside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I am asked to preside on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.58,0:26:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The other day, you returned in a hurry from Jing Province, disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.54,0:26:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think something must have gone wrong in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go to this festival without preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.14,0:26:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When Brother Jingsheng and I had a drink, I made an indiscreet remark,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.26,0:26:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but Brother Jingsheng didn't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.38,0:26:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Lady Cai and Cai Mao tried to murder me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.02,0:26:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Yi Ji's timely warning,\NI was able to escape to Xīnyě before dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.18,0:27:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's invitation to the festival...\NI do not know how it will turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.06,0:27:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You suspect that you made an indiscreet remark, but Lord Liu Biao didn't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.02,0:27:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't so easily trust the words of outsiders,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.26,0:27:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiāngyáng is not far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.70,0:27:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't go, Lord Liu Biao will genuinely become suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang has a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.86,0:27:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, one can't be too careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.86,0:27:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no "good" banquets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.86,0:27:28.46,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Alluding to the Hongmen Banquet
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.46,0:27:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better not to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.58,0:27:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My two elder brothers both have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.58,0:27:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't go, Lord Liu Biao would be suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go, Cai Mao might intend to murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.54,0:27:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I think you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.10,0:27:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead three hundred soldiers to escort you and make sure nothing happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.18,0:27:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.10,0:28:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass on my orders:\Nnothing is to be told to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.66,0:28:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who disobey will be put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.92,0:28:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.62,0:28:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.02,0:28:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General. Seeing your actions,\NI feel something is going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.06,0:28:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is a "mighty raptor" of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.06,0:28:29.66,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: A "Mighty Raptor" or "Xiāoxióng"({\fs21}{\fnNSimSun}枭雄{\fn}){\fs} is a term used for fierce, ambitious and formidable "great men" of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.62,0:28:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be a source of trouble if he stays here long.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.14,0:28:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to kill him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.82,0:28:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.02,0:28:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, the officials from the nine commanderies and forty-two counties are all at the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.38,0:28:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an act may make us lose their favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.10,0:28:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have secret orders from my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.02,0:28:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, we will do as he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.22,0:28:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The east, north and south gates of Xiāngyáng city\Nare guarded by my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.26,0:29:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the west gate is left open, \Nbecause the Tán Creek blocks the passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.54,0:29:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with tens of thousands of troops,\None could not get across that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.10,0:29:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If Liu Bei's officers follow and protect him, it would be hard to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.38,0:29:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already placed five hundred men in ambush inside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.34,0:29:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell Wén Pìn and Wang Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.38,0:29:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to arrange another table in the outer hall\Nand treat the officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.42,0:29:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First, separate Liu Bei from his officers.\NThen you can strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.94,0:29:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.26,0:29:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.26,0:29:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.22,0:29:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:30:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.90,0:30:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, excuse me for not coming to meet you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.22,0:30:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cai, you are so kind.\NExcuse me for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.62,0:30:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, this way please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.06,0:30:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, this way please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.02,0:30:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, my father is feeling unwell and could not come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.94,0:30:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The officials from the counties are all present. Please preside at the ceremonies on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:35.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(318.285,381.819)}Liú Cóng
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.94,0:30:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.58,0:30:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I normally wouldn't dare undertake such a heavy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.62,0:30:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But since it's my brother's order,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.66,0:30:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.50,0:30:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirs, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.98,0:30:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.50,0:31:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, please.\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.86,0:31:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, please.\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.74,0:31:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.94,0:31:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The banquet is ready in the side chamber
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.06,0:31:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and your presence is expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.94,0:31:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, generals, but you don't need to mind me. I can't drink alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.70,0:32:00.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(286.276,481.363)}Wén Pìn\NStyled: Zhòng Yè
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.50,0:32:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu.\NThe officers would like to drink with General Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.98,0:32:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you say to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.38,0:32:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong. Yes, it's ok to listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.74,0:32:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a seat at the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.38,0:32:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.46,0:32:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.14,0:32:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My two young lords, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.70,0:32:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.42,0:32:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.82,0:32:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Two young lords, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, have some more wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.66,0:32:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. You too, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.58,0:32:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, have some more drinks please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.22,0:32:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, have some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.22,0:33:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cai, everything is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.94,0:33:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.86,0:33:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,At the beating of the drum, you will strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.34,0:33:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let Liu Bei get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.58,0:33:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.58,0:33:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.18,0:33:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.38,0:33:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.98,0:33:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.54,0:33:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My two young lords, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.74,0:33:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, have another cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.06,0:33:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,May I show you the restroom, Lord Xuande?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.70,0:33:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.90,0:33:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have another cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.98,0:33:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even have another? Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.70,0:33:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, please do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.58,0:33:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Another toast to General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, General Zhao, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.98,0:33:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, please finish this cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.18,0:34:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good, good, good! Hahaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.18,0:34:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao plans to murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.90,0:34:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers have laid an ambush in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.50,0:34:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The east, north and south gates of the city are heavily guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.78,0:34:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the west gate is left open.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.14,0:34:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You should leave here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.82,0:34:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.66,0:34:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.46,0:34:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, General Zhao, drink! Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.50,0:34:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.58,0:34:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.78,0:34:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Report to General Cai\NLiu Bei rode out of the west gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.66,0:35:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Be sure to capture Liu Bei! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.70,0:35:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao, have another glass!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.18,0:35:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, chase him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dilu, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.38,0:35:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.02,0:36:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei, stop! Don't let Liu Bei escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.38,0:36:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dilu, Dilu, why do you harm your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.98,0:36:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Get into the water! \NCatch Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.86,0:36:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.14,0:36:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.94,0:36:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dilu!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.46,0:36:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cai, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.70,0:36:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.50,0:36:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life ends here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.66,0:36:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dilu, Dilu, you indeed harmed your master!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.42,0:36:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581}Heaven is helping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.38,0:37:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liu, why are you running away from the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.78,0:37:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao!\NWe have no grudge against each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.42,0:37:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you wish for my death!?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.98,0:37:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I have no such intention!\ND-don't be misled by others!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.30,0:37:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cai Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.42,0:38:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord is an invited guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.50,0:38:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you chasing him with troops?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.66,0:38:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's left the banquet. I don't know where he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.54,0:38:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.46,0:38:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.90,0:38:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.46,0:38:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't find him,\NI will come back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.70,0:38:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.02,0:39:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you must be Liu Xuande. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.38,0:39:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Country lad, how do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.10,0:39:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.22,0:39:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But my teacher often talks with his visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.78,0:39:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They say Liu Xuande is a hero of the age, and that he would pass by here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.38,0:39:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I find you look like the person they talk about, that's why I asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.10,0:39:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's your teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581}My master is {\i1}Sīmǎ Huī.{\i0}\NHis style name is Décāo. He's from Yǐngchuān.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.34,0:39:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581\pos(640,667.807)}His Daoist title is{\i1} Master Shuǐjìng.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.38,0:40:00.06,Note (Potential Style),,0,0,0,,Shuǐjìng = "Water Mirror"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.06,0:40:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581\pos(640,667.807)}Among his many friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.42,0:40:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581}there are {\i1}Páng Dégōng{\i0} \Nand{\i1} Páng Tǒng{\i0} from Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.46,0:40:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581\pos(640,667.807)}And who are these two Pángs?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.34,0:40:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581\pos(640,667.807)}They're uncle and nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.98,0:40:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581\i1}Páng Dégōng,{\i0} style name {\i1}Shanming,{\i0}\Nis ten years older than my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.78,0:40:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581\i1}Páng Tǒng,{\i0} style name {\i1}Shìyuán,{\i0}\N he is five years younger than my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.66,0:40:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.581}My master is very fond of Páng Tǒng\Nand calls him his younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.50,0:40:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your master now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.58,0:40:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In the cottage in the woods right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.62,0:40:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come with me, General Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.54,0:40:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.70,0:40:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice place!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.58,0:41:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The melody is so beautiful.\NWe may as well listen to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.06,0:41:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.78,0:41:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A high note suddenly rang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.26,0:41:58.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(407.354,485.454)}Sīmǎ Huī\NStyled: Décāo
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.46,0:42:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It suggests that a hero must be listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.30,0:42:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my master, Master Shuijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.42,0:42:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, today you're fortunate to have a narrow escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.70,0:42:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in and have a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.70,0:42:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If sir would please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.10,0:43:02.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658.166,674.843)}{\bord10.706}The blade's light and sword's shadow fade,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.10,0:43:02.70,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k52}Àn{\k44}dàn{\k60}liao {\k77}dāo{\k64}guāng{\k146}jiàn{\k117}yǐng
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.22,0:43:08.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658.166,674.843)}{\bord10.706}Far away is the drum and horn's serenade;
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.22,0:43:08.90,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k68}yuǎn {\k48}qù{\k36}liao {\k39}gǔ{\k37}jiǎo {\k91}zhēng {\k249}míng
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.26,0:43:14.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658.166,674.843)}{\bord10.706}Before my eyes appear, one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.26,0:43:14.86,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k68}Yǎn{\k96}qián {\k74}fēi{\k42}yáng{\k41}zhe {\k67}yī{\k74}gè {\k98}gè{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.22,0:43:20.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658.166,674.843)}{\bord10.706}Such vibrant visages.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.22,0:43:20.70,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k93}xiān {\k35}huó {\k45}de {\k179}miàn{\k196}róng
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.42,0:43:27.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658.166,674.843)}{\bord10.706}The old paths are buried now,
